<h1 id="uiwfg-title" style="color:#0d47a1;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #90caf9;padding-bottom:0.25em;margin-top:0">UI wireframe & diagram — generic (portable)</h1>

**Purpose:** Help humans and agents **visualize web page UI** in Markdown docs using **ASCII wireframes** (layout chrome) and **Mermaid** (logic, flows, dependencies). **Project-agnostic** — copy this file into any repo’s `.cursor/rules/`.

**Trigger:** User says **`uiwfg`**, “wireframe this screen”, “ASCII mockup”, “UI diagram for this page”, or **`@uiwfg-ui-wireframe-ascii-generic`**.

**Not for:** Pixel-perfect Figma specs, component prop APIs, or backend-only architecture with no UI surface.

