<h2 id="checklist" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Quality checklist</h2>

- [ ] Medium chosen deliberately (ASCII vs Mermaid vs both).
- [ ] ASCII uses box-drawing frame and **`text`** fence.
- [ ] Active/selected state marked (`●` or explicit label).
- [ ] At least one `←` annotation per major band.
- [ ] In-page tabs/chips **named**; not “content here”.
- [ ] Route/label table follows wireframes when URLs exist.
- [ ] Mermaid ≤ ~11 nodes; semantic `style` if colored.
- [ ] Unshipped modes marked `(hold)` or equivalent.
- [ ] Project-specific chrome delegated to a **local** rule (if any), not duplicated here.
